title: Process Ghosting / Herpaderping
id: 51908fcf-3803-42f2-9e72-ac48ef18261a
status: experimental
description: Detects process ghosting and herpaderping, where a process is created from a delete-pending or post-write-modified image so the on-disk file differs from the running image, surfaced by Sysmon process tampering.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: process_tampering
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 25
    Type|contains:
      - 'Image is locked for access'
      - 'Image is replaced'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - Image
  - Type
falsepositives:
  - Some legitimate packers
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1055
